<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CONSMODDER Q1 PRE-CAPEX NET PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>CONSMODDER Q1 PRE-CAPEX NET PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus</p>
<p>preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending</p>
<p>					   0.09 vs 3.45</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 1.01 vs 0.97</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		  93,445 vs 111,708</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)	     385.99 vs 480.90</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		   4.13 vs 4.30</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 51,872 vs 49,424</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    50,779 vs 56,078 </p>
<p>Full name: Consolidated Modderfontein Mines Ltd </p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the unexpended balance of capital</p>
<p>expenditure voted by ConsModder, which is managed by Golden</p>
<p>Dumps Ltd, amounted to 4.2 million rand at March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
